<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Settings | ActiveHub</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/css/bootstrap.min.css"
        integrity="sha384-ggOyR0iXCbMQv3Xipma34MD+dH/1fQ784/j6cY/iJTQUOhcWr7x9JvoRxT2MZw1T" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <%- include('partials/accessibility-styles') %>
</head>

<body class="bg-light">
    <%- include('partials/navigation') %>
    <main class="container py-5">
        <header class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end mb-4">
            <div>
                <p class="text-uppercase text-muted small mb-1">ActiveHub</p>
                <h1 class="h2 mb-1">Settings</h1>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0">Configure the site and booking credit requests</p>
            </div>
        </header>

        <% if (saved) { %><div class="alert alert-success" role="status">Settings saved.</div><% } %>
        <% if (error) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">The title is required and must be <%= maxLength %> characters or fewer.</div><% } %>

        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-3" aria-labelledby="site-title-heading">
            <h2 class="h5" id="site-title-heading">Site title</h2>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="site_title">Title shown at the top of the home page</label>
                    <input class="form-control" id="site_title" name="site_title" type="text" maxlength="<%= maxLength %>" required value="<%= siteTitle %>" aria-describedby="site-title-help">
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="site-title-help">Up to <%= maxLength %> characters.</small>
                </div>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save</button>
            </form>
            <% if (organisationError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger mt-3" role="alert">Enter an organisation name of <%= maxLength %> characters or fewer.</div><% } %>
            <form class="mt-3" method="POST" action="/admin/settings/organisation">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="organisation-name">Organisation name</label>
                    <input class="form-control" id="organisation-name" name="organisation_name" type="text" maxlength="<%= maxLength %>" required value="<%= organisationName %>" aria-describedby="organisation-help">
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="organisation-help">Used in the credit and refund guidance. Defaults to Peck'em.</small>
                </div>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save organisation name</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-3 mt-3" aria-labelledby="membership-scheme-heading">
            <h2 class="h5" id="membership-scheme-heading">Membership scheme</h2>
            <% if (locals.membershipError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter a membership scheme name of <%= maxLength %> characters or fewer.</div><% } %>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/membership-scheme">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="membership-scheme">Membership scheme name</label>
                    <input class="form-control" id="membership-scheme" name="membership_scheme" type="text" maxlength="<%= maxLength %>" required value="<%= locals.membershipScheme || 'GLL Better Card' %>" aria-describedby="membership-scheme-help">
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="membership-scheme-help">Used before "membership number" in My membership. Changing the scheme name does not change saved membership numbers.</small>
                </div>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save membership scheme</button>
            </form>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-3 mt-3" aria-labelledby="site-logo-heading">
            <h2 class="h5" id="site-logo-heading">Logo</h2>
            <% if (hasLogo) { %>
                <div class="border rounded p-3 mb-3 bg-light d-inline-block"><img src="/site-logo?v=<%= Date.now() %>" alt="Current logo" style="height: 3rem; width: auto; max-width: 16rem;"></div>
            <% } else { %>
                <p class="text-muted">No logo set. Only the site title is shown.</p>
            <% } %>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/logo" data-admin-logo>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="site_logo">Upload a logo</label>
                    <input class="form-control-file" id="site_logo" name="site_logo" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/svg+xml" aria-describedby="site-logo-help" required>
                    <small class="form-text text-muted" id="site-logo-help">PNG, JPEG, WebP or SVG, up to 512 KB. It appears in the public header and admin navigation bar.</small>
                </div>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="logo-upload">Upload logo</button>
            </form>
            <% if (hasLogo) { %>
                <form class="d-inline ml-2" method="POST" action="/admin/settings/logo/remove">
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-danger" type="submit">Remove logo</button>
                </form>
            <% } %>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-3 mt-3" aria-labelledby="request-window">
            <h2 id="request-window" class="h5">Credit request period</h2>
            <p>Credits and refunds shows only bookings that ended within this many days. Residents can submit new credit requests only for those bookings. Existing requests remain available for review.</p>
            <% if (windowSaved) { %><div class="alert alert-success" role="status">Credit request period saved.</div><% } %>
            <% if (windowError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter a whole number of days from 1 to 365.</div><% } %>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/credit-request-period">
                <label for="credit-request-days">Number of days</label>
                <input class="form-control mb-2" id="credit-request-days" name="days" type="number" min="1" max="365" step="1" required value="<%= creditRequestDays %>">
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="submit">Save period</button>
            </form>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-3 mt-3" aria-labelledby="credit-lifetime-heading">
            <h2 id="credit-lifetime-heading" class="h5">Credit lifetime</h2>
            <p>How many days newly issued credits remain available, measured from issue time. Changing this does not alter existing expiry dates. Spent or expired credits are hidden and cannot be used at checkout. A bank refund requested before expiry remains available for administrator review.</p>
            <% if (lifetimeError) { %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Enter a whole number of days from 1 to 36500.</div><% } %>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/credit-lifetime">
                <label for="credit-lifetime-days">Credit lifetime in days</label>
                <input class="form-control mb-2" id="credit-lifetime-days" name="days" type="number" min="1" max="36500" step="1" required value="<%= creditLifetimeDays %>">
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="submit">Save credit lifetime</button>
            </form>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-white border rounded shadow-sm p-3 mt-3" aria-labelledby="auto-approval-heading">
            <h2 id="auto-approval-heading" class="h5">Weather credit slot auto-approval</h2>
            <p>Allow administrators to approve a time slot across all facilities. Pending and later Weather requests for the exact same start and end time receive credit automatically. The card-paid portion is refundable; reissued credits retain their original refund eligibility. Only Weather requests can be auto-approved. Other requests require individual review; their card-paid portion is non-refundable unless the administrator allows a bank refund.</p>
            <p>Disabling pauses all saved slots without removing them or reversing credits. Re-enabling applies them to new requests; requests submitted while disabled still require review. The slot list uses the Credit request period above.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/admin/settings/credit-slot-auto-approval">
                <label for="credit-slot-auto-approval">Auto-approval</label>
                <select class="form-control mb-2" id="credit-slot-auto-approval" name="enabled">
                    <option value="0" <%= !autoApprovalEnabled ? 'selected' : '' %>>Disabled</option>
                    <option value="1" <%= autoApprovalEnabled ? 'selected' : '' %>>Enabled</option>
                </select>
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" type="submit">Save auto-approval</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>

</html>
